              "text": "Form linear equation: 27 + 3x + 21 = 72 (or 3x + 48 = 72)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq03_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Solve for x: 3x = 24, so x = 8.00 dollars."
