              "text": "Calculate new total score = 6860 + 2 = 6862."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq06_p03_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate new combined mean = 6862 / 100 = 68.62 (or 68.6 to 3 s.f.)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07",
      "parts": [
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p01",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p01_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Set up total frequency equation: 14 + 26 + k + 16 = 80."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p01_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Solve for k: k = 80 - 56 = 24."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p01_c03",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "State the 4 midpoints: 10, 30, 50, 80."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p02",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p02_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate fx products: 14(10) = 140, 26(30) = 780, 24(50) = 1200, 16(80) = 1280."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p02_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Sum products to obtain sum(fx) = 140 + 780 + 1200 + 1280 = 3400."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Divide by 80 to obtain estimated mean = 3400 / 80 = 42.5 marks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p03",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p03_c01",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that the 5 students cross the class boundary from [20, 40) into [40, 60), decreasing the frequency of [20, 40) by 5 and increasing [40, 60) by 5."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p03_c02",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Calculate change in sum(fx): 5 students shift from midpoint 30 to midpoint 50, so delta sum(fx) = 5 * (50 - 30) = +100."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m03_l01_cpq07_p03_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate increase in estimated mean: 100 / 80 = +1.25 marks (giving new estimated mean = 43.75 marks)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
